<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=mscorlib">

    <!-- Keys are grouped by the surface they appear on. Every key here must also exist in
         Strings.en.xaml — StringsParityTests fails the build otherwise. Strings holding {0}
         are composite formats consumed through LocalizationService.Format.

         Keys keep the names features had when they were added, and those names can lag behind
         what the screen says: S.QuickTranslate.* and S.Settings.QuickTranslate* belong to 替換翻譯
         (In-place translation), renamed from 快速翻譯 in #277 — see QuickTranslateSettings — and
         S.QuickLookup.* to 取詞翻譯 (Quick lookup), whose Japanese and Korean names were changed in
         the same issue. -->

